  "headings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open the team",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Fleet, open <strong>Hosts</strong> and choose your Deploy App's team at the top, such as <code>golden-monkey DeployApp</code>. Then press <strong>Add hosts</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/95b773aaa7191df8.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 766
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Get the enrolment link",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Choose <strong>Android</strong>, keep <strong>Personal (BYOD)</strong> and copy the link. Send it to the phones.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b38688edc2fca7e8.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 1221
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the link on the phone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open the link and tap <strong>Enroll</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/13980932ec6c3a74.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set up the work profile",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Next</strong>, and <strong>Continue</strong> if asked.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e7f89bb3db7e6a4b.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Accept",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Accept &#x26; continue</strong>, then <strong>Next</strong> if asked.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e0d676c54c6c7569.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Done",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Done</strong>. Within a few minutes the apps appear in the phone's <strong>Work</strong> tab.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6ff5b74a5a7be991.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Phones already in Fleet",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>A phone already in another team? On <strong>Hosts</strong>, tick it and press <strong>Transfer</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8dcfc754b4a6a05b.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 766
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick the team",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Pick your Deploy App's team and press <strong>Transfer</strong>. To get this team's apps as well, remove the work profile and enrol the phone again with this team's link.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4ed14db1849952ca.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 1135
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Then name them",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The phones show up in the connector, <strong>waiting for a name</strong>: go on with <strong>Name phones</strong> in <strong>Bringing users via MDM</strong>. Without the connector, see <strong>Name phones in Fleet without the connector</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/85c6549c4adbb79d.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 1273
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
